Dispatched to the agent. Final SHA triple: `756c38d` (keep pooled connections alive), `5b00abc` (double the HTTP worker pool), `3543e9e` (close the socket behind a retired response). Formula: `worker_count = queued_requests * 2`, `worker_ceiling = max(worker_count, max_http_clients)`, `ThreadPool(worker_count, worker_ceiling, queued_requests)`. At defaults (1+16): 34 workers. Pool harness 11/11 with the starvation control proving the raw +1 construction would fail; retirement harness re-run 15/15. Both falsification families flip. `third_party/` empty, 8 intended files, no strays.

