| arm (t7–9) | started label | thinking census | cache% at switch | t8/t9 |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| OFF2 `enable_thinking:false` | `thinking off` | **0 / 0 / 0** | **98.8%** | 99.3 / 99.3 |
| HEADBUST `reasoning_effort:low` | `thinking low` | 291 / 283 / 192 | **0.0%** | 99.4 / 99.4 |
| GC2 control | template default | 476 / 467 / 146 | (cold baseline) | — |

